hapes printed into the other's highlights\n- displacement: one shot pushes the other's pixels by its brightness\n- datamosh blocks, cut-in rectangles, echo trails, 1-frame flicks, a tint\n- a pixel-sort burst right on the cut\n- built from the clean render, then placed under the CRT / VHS", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HOW THE TRANSITIONS WORK\n- shot A runs on past the cut, shot B starts early\n- double exposure: one shot's dark shapes printed into the other's highlights\n- displacement: one shot pushes the other's pixels by its brightness\n- datamosh blocks, cut-in rectangles, echo trails, 1-frame flicks, a tint\n- a pixel-sort burst right on the cut\n- built from the clean render, then placed under the CRT / VHS", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 26}, {"id": "fcaf4a5acfa6cf3e", "type": "text", "x": 4200, "y": 595, "width": 972.4000000000001, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 290217689, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 728202359, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "[00:00:37:13 - 00:00:58:09] Cracks and slashes on the ending's cards", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "[00:00:37:13 - 00:00:58:09] Cracks and slashes on the ending's cards", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 26}, {"id": "36891eeb6de2b33b", "type": "image", "x": 4200, "y": 639, "width": 1000, "height": 141, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "transparent", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 572380515, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2